	-- ===== Secret Fusion (4021, FusionService replaces the old fuse remote): FusionMenu 303564-305060, FusionConfig 379622,
	-- FusionOdds 379757, FusionPools 380251. Four Secret pets (FusionConfig.Inputs) go into the machine with
	-- FusionService.RF.Start {PetIds, Lucky, Unlock} -> {Success, Reason}; the server keeps the egg in
	-- Data.Machines.Fusion.Slot {Size, EndTime, StartedAt, Pools, NewEgg} (Small 1.5 h / Big 3 h / Huge 6 h by the fuel of the
	-- four, 50K / 150K / 400K Gems, FusionConfig.Cost); FusionService.RF.Claim() when EndTime has passed -> {Success, Pool,
	-- Pet, NewEgg} (a Secret of the Mythical / old / new-island / Halloween pool). Lucky = a Robux charge (never), Unlock =
	-- "unlock my locked inputs" (never: a locked pet is the player's keep mark). The menu opens only on the Fusion
	-- InteractionPoint (pointUnder 304985), so both calls are tried from where the hub stands first and at the machine
	-- when the server refuses. OWNER_RULES 21/23: fusing is irreversible, so Auto Fusion is its own toggle outside the
	-- Smart Planner (N.Consumers), it never takes a species below "Copies to keep", never a locked / equipped / team /
